// BESSER's limit (besser/instances/limit.py) in the Exam DSL: 4-semester with no weights.
// Six exams of a semester, three batches. Feasible: cost 0.
// 8-limit.exam solved by quantum annealing (D-Wave QPU) instead: keep the problems identical.
// Needs DWAVE_API_TOKEN at run time; without it, run_generated copies recorded/quantum_annealing/ (ADR-0010).
problem limit_quantum_annealing batches 3
students Ana Rui Eva Ivo Lia Tom
exam Algebra     { Ana Rui }
exam Calculus    { Rui Eva Tom }
exam Physics     { Ana Eva }
exam Chemistry   { Ivo Lia }
exam Programming { Lia Tom }
exam Databases   { Ivo Ana }

solver { method quantum_annealing sampler qpu reads 500 annealing_time 200 seed 7 }
